ArcaNN iteration 005) used to drive every LAMMPS+DeepMD run in this LFER_3_mg2/ analysis
(pph3/, pph4/) — the production committee, one ArcaNN iteration on from the iteration-004
committee whose per-member consistency was checked in ../../NNP_LFER_choice/ (see that
folder's README).

